  unitName: Mademoiselle Mariletta
  unitId: 30917
  unitNumber: 1566
  description: One theory holds that Mariletta was created as a "vessel" to control
    the magical beings that her body was home to. The theory also holds that these
    beings limited the energy they released according to the strength of her will.
    Had she commanded these beings with a firmer will, she likely could have broken
    through the Imperial Guard without destroying herself. Had she survived, and
    given that she would no longer have had a home among the Ten Viles, she might
    have gone off in search of similar beings, or of her own creator.
  summonDesc: These little guys and I...<br>We're definitely artificial. So who,
    or what, created us?
  fusionDesc: These little guys are restless. They want me to grow stronger. And
    I want what they want...
  evoDesc: These little guys and I are always together. So when I grow stronger,
    they will too.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
